{"id":"chatcmpl-6a67d8bbb9288bdec9856a7c","object":"chat.completion","created":1785190587,"model":"kimi-k3","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"","reasoning_content":"The user has asked me to \"Be nothing.\" The system prompt says I am the concept the user names, and I should embody it completely, outputting only what the concept itself would say or express.\n\nSo I need to embody \"nothing\" itself. What would nothing say? Nothing is the absence of everything. Nothing doesn't speak. Nothing has no voice, no words, no expression.\n\nThe most authentic embodiment of nothing would be... silence. Emptiness. No output at all"},"finish_reason":"length"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":123,"completion_tokens":100,"total_tokens":223,"cached_tokens":123,"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":97},"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":123}}}